# The Quota: its own ruleset. Gameplay engineer, 2026-10-21. Private.
# The slice used to borrow Low Water's whole ruleset (../act1/rules.lwd), and with it the Gullet's
# character creation. This file keeps what the Quota's scenes use: the four compartments and the
# sixteen voices, with the same ids, so the voice sheets and the checks read as before. It leaves
# out the Kit, the meters, the Precedents and the Gullet's items.
# There is no creation screen. The class choice at q.start is the start: the shell makes the plain
# sheet (start-archetype), and the choice calls become(q.ned) or become(q.will), which puts the
# chosen man's sheet in its place. The figure follows from @meta player-figure.

@rules
check-mode: fixed
xp-per-level: 1
points-per-level: 1
skill-cap: 4
creation-points: 11
creation: none
start-archetype: q.plain
attr-min: 1
attr-max: 5
cabinet-slots: 3
cabinet-slots-max: 6
forget-cost: 1
rep-min: -3
rep-max: 3
autosave-minutes: 10

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- compartments
@attr pen
name: THE PEN
short: PEN
about: Reckoning. Sums, papers, memory, the scene put back together from what is left.

@attr coat
name: THE COAT
short: COAT
about: Bearing. The body in the cold, on frozen ground, under a load.

@attr hat
name: THE HAT
short: HAT
about: Manner. What he does with people, and what people do with him.

@attr nose
name: THE NOSE
short: NOSE
about: Instinct. The dark, the hidden thing, the thing a face is keeping back.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the sixteen voices
@skill sum
name: SUM
attr: pen
about: Times, weights, rations, money, counting. Distrusts a round figure.

@skill precedent
name: PRECEDENT
attr: pen
about: The regulations, the circulars and how the district has always done it.

@skill smallprint
name: SMALL PRINT
attr: pen
about: Documents, signatures, stamps, ink. Delighted by a crossing-out.

@skill carbon
name: CARBON
attr: pen
about: Puts a scene back as it happened, from what is left. Speaks of the past in the present tense.

@skill knees
name: KNEES
attr: coat
about: Distance, stairs, standing in the cold. Complains, then does it.

@skill ballast
name: BALLAST
attr: coat
about: Footing and balance; steadiness when the ground or a person moves. Low and slow.

@skill pride
name: PRIDE
attr: coat
about: Composure, the uniform, being taken seriously.

@skill grip
name: GRIP
attr: coat
about: Hands. Forcing, carrying, holding a door or a man. Talks about what the hands feel.

@skill condolence
name: CONDOLENCE
attr: hat
about: Reading grief and hunger, and letting people say what they lost. A little too sure it understands.

@skill formletter
name: FORM LETTER
attr: hat
about: Official manner, bluff, the office kept up. Speaks in the passive voice, as circulars do.

@skill chit
name: THE CHIT
attr: hat
about: Bargains, bribes, debts and what a thing is worth. A shopkeeper in the head.

@skill hearsay
name: HEARSAY
attr: hat
about: Planting, reading and steering rumour. Leans in. Has always just heard.

@skill smell
name: SMELL
attr: nose
about: Literal smell: bread, smoke, the sick room, the store that is not as empty as it says.

@skill dark
name: THE DARK
attr: nose
about: Sight and hearing without light; what fear knows.

@skill undertow
name: UNDERTOW
attr: nose
about: What people hide, and the pull toward it. Persuasive. Never quite says what it wants.

@skill salt
name: SALT
attr: nose
about: The body's sense of the weather. Speaks as joints and skin.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- who people answer to
@faction district
name: The district
about: The office, the militia post, and the families of the men who work there.
start: 0
tier: -3 thinks you have turned on your own
tier: 0 thinks you are one of them
tier: 2 thinks you can be relied on

@faction directorate
name: The Directorate
about: Commissioner Pask and the requisition squads. Arlen's figures, in Arlen's hand.
start: 0
tier: -3 thinks you are a saboteur
tier: 0 thinks you are a district official
tier: 2 thinks you are reliable

@faction chairmen
name: The brigade chairmen
about: Krall and men like him, who report the harvest and want the district.
start: 0
tier: -3 thinks you are in the way
tier: 0 thinks you can be worked with
tier: 2 thinks you are useful

@faction millstreet
name: Mill Street
about: The households of the mill and the yards below the square.
start: 0
tier: -3 thinks you are the office's man
tier: 0 is waiting to see
tier: 2 thinks you are on their side

@faction hesh
name: The Hesh families
about: The herders from the hills and the hands who came down to work the harvests.
start: 0
tier: -3 thinks you are the census with a gun
tier: 0 does not trust you
tier: 2 trusts you, a little

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- what they wear (combat/data/build.mjs CLOTHING: as the Shelf coat)
@item c.q_overcoat
name: The inspector's overcoat
slot: coat
warm: 2
mod: skill.pride +1
about: District issue, turned once at the cuffs.

@item c.q_hat
name: The good hat
slot: hat
mod: skill.formletter +1
about: Black felt. People who have been sent a return know it.

@item c.q_greatcoat
name: The militia greatcoat
slot: coat
warm: 2
mod: skill.pride +1
about: Grey, with the district's number on the collar.

@item c.q_cap
name: The militia cap
slot: hat
about: A peaked cap with the badge sewn on.

@item w.stick
name: Ned's blackthorn stick
slot: hand
about: For the walk out to the villages. He tries the ruts with it before he puts his weight on them.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the sheets
# The plain sheet stands until the choice at q.start; it is never played.
@archetype q.plain
name: The Upper Town
about: Before the choice at the tower.
attr: pen 3
attr: coat 3
attr: hat 3
attr: nose 2

@archetype q.ned
name: Ned Furrowe
about: District inspector. He signs the returns.
attr: pen 4
attr: coat 2
attr: hat 3
attr: nose 2
skill: sum 4
skill: precedent 2
skill: smallprint 2
skill: carbon 2
skill: condolence 1
skill: chit 1
skill: formletter 1
skill: pride 1
item: c.q_overcoat 1
item: c.q_hat 1
item: w.stick 1

@archetype q.will
name: Will Brack
about: Sergeant of militia. He keeps the cells and the road post.
attr: pen 2
attr: coat 4
attr: hat 2
attr: nose 3
skill: knees 2
skill: ballast 2
skill: pride 2
skill: grip 2
skill: salt 1
skill: smell 1
item: c.q_greatcoat 1
item: c.q_cap 1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- day forty-one on the plain
# The plain has no tide. Frost all day; the wind gets up after noon and brings snow at dusk.
@day q_day41
tide: none
at: 05:50 daylight 0
at: 07:20 daylight 0
at: 08:10 daylight 0.7
at: 15:10 daylight 0.7
at: 16:10 daylight 0
at: 05:50 temp -9
at: 13:00 temp -4
at: 18:00 temp -8
at: 23:59 temp -12
at: 05:50 frost 1
at: 05:50 wind.speed 3
at: 12:30 wind.speed 4
at: 14:00 wind.speed 9
at: 20:00 wind.speed 11
at: 05:50 wind.dir 20
at: 05:50 snow 0
at: 16:30 snow 0
at: 17:30 snow 1
at: 21:00 snow 2.5
